[ve:0.2.7]
[00:11.12]I learned to smile with my teeth clenched tight
[00:16.64]Gold on my tongue, steel in my spine
[00:22.58]They call it luck, I call it work
[00:28.28]I don’t survive — I rise every time
[00:35.71]I don’t wait for doors to open
[00:38.26]I make them nervous till they do
[00:41.19]If I look flawless under pressure
[00:44.10]It’s because pressure taught me how to move
[00:47.63]I don’t fall apart
[00:50.50]I don’t crack in view
[00:53.57]If I’m breaking
[00:56.18]You’ll never know the truth
[01:01.41]I was built to shine
[01:03.32]Even when it hurts
[01:06.68]I wear my hunger like a crown
[01:09.85]And make it work
[01:12.29]I was built to shine
[01:15.48]Not to be enough — to win
[01:18.77]If love is power
[01:20.49]Then I learned
[01:21.75]How to discipline it
[01:26.22]They say relax, like that’s a cure
[01:29.16]Like letting go won’t cost me ground
[01:32.19]I don’t trust comfort, I trust control
[01:35.13]Soft hands don’t hold the world down
[01:37.70]Every step is calculated
[01:40.46]Every breath a silent vow
[01:43.22]If I ever look like I’m glowing
[01:46.39]That’s the armor doing its job
[01:50.18]I don’t beg
[01:51.63]I don’t plead
[01:53.17]I perform
[01:54.39]And I succeed
[01:58.21]I was built to shine
[02:02.18]Under lights that burn
[02:04.56]I turn fear into fuel
[02:08.64]And let it churn
[02:11.85]I was built to shine
[02:14.95]Even starving for more
[02:17.27]I don’t need permission
[02:19.79]I decide
[02:21.06]What I’m worth
[02:24.82]Silk voice
[02:26.41]Sharp design
[02:27.91]Say my name
[02:29.21]Watch me climb
[02:30.85]Sweet on the surface
[02:32.20]Perfectly staged
[02:33.56]But I don’t forget
[02:34.82]What hunger made
[02:39.91]🎵
[02:50.26]I was built to shine
[02:53.13]Not to fade out slow
[02:56.85]If I’m flawless
[02:58.25]It’s because I learned
[02:59.75]What to show
[03:02.93]I was built to shine
[03:04.48]With my teeth in the knife
[03:07.83]I don’t dream of safety
[03:10.33]I earn
[03:12.29]My life
[03:19.95]I don’t need saving.
[03:22.99]I need space.
[03:26.41]And I take it.
